{"unit_id": "Kayungko__dsh-plugin-task-coordinator#feature-1", "repo": "Kayungko/dsh-plugin-task-coordinator", "commit": "fb32849c26102a92f94fd612f33e5ba0a140ecb8", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Task Coordinator 的功能「派生任务会话」：总控可提交标题和自包含提示词，创建新的 DSH 会话；可指定工作目录、团队和子任务模型，并可要求完成后回报。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["tools.mjs:115"]}
